  "worked_solution": "Approaching from the right, we have $x>8,$ so we use the expression $f(x)=\\sqrt[3]{x}+2.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {8}^{+}}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to {8}^{+}}(\\sqrt[3]{x}+2) \\\\  & =\\sqrt[3]{8}+2 \\\\  & =2+2 \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
